      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm, tested models at 1-1-1 scale, animations play perfectly.  Shifting the scale to anything above or below this produces an effect where if scaled below 1-1-1, avatar now clips into the ground.  Opposite effect with scaling up.  \nDefault animations provided by SDK controller tested along with custom dances and user created emotes.  All animations move based on avatar scale in unity.  This was not the case with 2.0.\nOnly visible to other users when playing said animations, everything looks normal from the host side.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
